      "section": "The gap",
      "title": "No public tool we found combines PCF/entity/typelist/template/Gosu evidence into one disposition + assumption packet",
      "key_points": [
        "Explicitly acknowledged: Guidewire CUE, Cloud Assurance Services, Lighthouse, SurePath, Developer Assistants, GoQu, CAST/ADDI (portfolio and code discovery), Syntra ETL (data migration/extraction), SI assessments",
        "Gap = cross-artefact feature evidence + disposition ledger + assumption register + packet",
        "Positioning, not an independent product evaluation"
